sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Auth page
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Trigger as profile trigger
    participant DB as profiles
    User->>UI: Submit credentials
    UI->>Auth: Sign in or sign up
    Auth-->>UI: JWT session
    Auth->>Trigger: New auth user
    Trigger->>DB: Create attendee profile
    UI->>DB: Fetch profile and role
    DB-->>UI: RBAC profile
